  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the&nbsp;latus rectum of a&nbsp;parabola, whose focus is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the tangent at its vertex is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given the equation of tangent at vertex is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>and the focus is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0044_e649913b1501.png\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Now the perpendicular distance from focus to tangent is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Also given length of latus rectum<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
